<title>USA: Thermo Cardiosystems to acquire Nimbus.</title>
<headline>Thermo Cardiosystems to acquire Nimbus.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Cardiosystems Inc said on Monday it has signed a letter of intent to acquire the assets of Nimbus Medical Inc, a privately held research and development organization.</p>
<p>For the first six months of 1996, Nimbus, which has been involved in artificial heart technology, had revenues of approximately $1 million. Financial terms were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The proposed acquisition is subject to a definitive agreement, due diligence and other approvals.</p>
